      "text": "Whether `claude mcp add --transport http` accepts `--header` (or equivalent) for injecting the `x-api-key` header at install time, or whether the header must live in a separate config file such as `.claude/mcp.json`, is an open question deferred to the Claude Code CLI docs check in T-007 / Design.",
